# Only exclude private keys here — public keys must be tracked so the
# flake's base module can read authorized-keys/bs-deploy.pub at eval
# time. Nix flakes filter the source tree by `git ls-files`, so a
# gitignored pubkey would silently be missing from the store copy at
# install time, producing a deploy user with no authorized_keys and
# no way in.
*
!README.md
!.gitignore
!*.pub
